383,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第9题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 振幅为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\sqrt{2}cm"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 周期小于 "},{"type":"math","value":"8\\times10^{-2}s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 最大加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"100m/s^{2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 半个周期内，两弹簧对滑块冲量的矢量和为零"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q10","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511","source_question_id":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8026144b368279f4ef6ad3821b9dfa692e47bd2dec5c4754ce34945df9536487","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 如图所示，在点电荷 Q 产生的电场作用下，位于下方 h 的原子将被极化，其负电荷中心与正电荷中心出现很小距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"l(l \\ll h)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，形成电偶极子。用于描写电偶极子的特征量——电偶极矩 p = ql，其中 q 是正负点电荷所带电荷量的绝对值。实验表明 "},{"type":"math","value":"p = \\alpha E, \\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 为极化系数，只与原子本身有关，E 为 Q 在电偶极子中心产生的场强。则处于如图所示位置的被极化的原子与点电荷 Q 之间的电场力 F 为\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/67d40eea8e72ecffc07d534aa60ffe12eaaac01958a624af3cb516dc15ee55cb.png","width":138,"height":396,"width_mm":16.228,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第10题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 若只 Q 电量加倍，F 将变为原来的 4 倍"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 若只 Q 电量加倍，F 将变为原来的 8 倍"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若只 h 减半，F 将变为原来的 8 倍"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若只 h 减半，F 将变为原来的 16 倍"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q11","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511","source_question_id":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","热学","电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b33a5559b2a50d825729fd5614ab8bd6c185a0bb796fee26f7c5a0a8c4870712","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11. 关于以下四张图片