数恰好为 0。保持装置不变，改用光 II 照射，电流表示数为 0，调节滑片 P，当电压表示数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{II}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，电流表中开始有电流通过。则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6ea7d885f36d48150b2eaa45f0a117299d6accf1afa4d263e01d9364d0843978.png","width":291,"height":374,"width_mm":34.219,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第12题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 光 I 产生的光电子的初动能比光 II 大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 产生光 I 时，氢原子跃迁到的能级更低"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. I、II 两光分别垂直入射同一劈尖，光 I 条纹间距更大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 改用光 II 照射后，滑片向 b 端移动电流表中才能有电流"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q13","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511","source_question_id":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"de7ae1c908190e450239d37bafab4bbbad73ec2eb8bc0d262ec054ee30acddc9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示，两连续振动波源 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 分别位于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = -0.9\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处， "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 的振幅为 "},{"type":"math","value":"3\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 的振幅为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，振动周期均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.4\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，形成两列简谐横波分别沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向和负方向传播，图示为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻的波形图， "},{"type":"math","value":"x < 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 区域为介质 1， "},{"type":"math","value":"x > 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 区域为介质 2。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c4125b488672fcd53217f775bc4ca4be22b1f7ab695dee86564ed66bfe5595ba.png","width":1221,"height":222,"width_mm":143.581,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第13题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 波源的起振方向沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴向下"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 1.5\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处质点的位移为 "},{"type":"math","value":"5\\mathrm{cm}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 稳定后， "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.3\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点振动减弱"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 稳定后，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"[-0.6\\mathrm{m},0]"},{"type":"text","value":" （含 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = -0.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ）区间有5个振动加强点"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511","source_question_id":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"456b08b95bdbf31625773d407b3384e2c11e2859705b2dea12f91e2a69efec18","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（Ⅰ、Ⅱ两题共14分）\n14-Ⅰ.（7分）在“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”的实验中，实验装置如图1所示。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bd1378b3269b83a804c36e01806115e416800a92a3b1ceec398f8415cf71dc07.png","width":1062,"height":360,"width_mm":124.883,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-Ⅰ题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/667532f116180e0a08bf348b9046c51ada126d20dd3ad422dd0c7e039ab7e9e5.png","width":1080,"height":192,"width_mm":127,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-1题图2\n（1）关于本实验，下列说法正确的是（填空）（多选）\nA. 采用控制变量的方法\nB. 调节轨道的倾斜度，使小车在不受牵引时恰能静止在轨道上\nC. 通过改变槽码的个数可以改变小车所受的拉力\nD. 实验时小车运动的速度尽可能快些\n（2）图 2 所示为某次实验打出的一条纸带，选取点 A、B、C、D、E、F、G 为计数点，相邻计数点间的时间间隔是 0.1 s，则计数点 E 的读数为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"，小车的加速度大小（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（保留 2 位有效数字）。\n（3）图 3 是利用气垫导轨“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”的实验装置。气轨置于水平桌面上，测出挡光条的宽度 d，将滑块移至图示位置，测出挡光条到光电门的距离 l，静止释放滑块，读出挡光条通过光电门的挡光时间 t，用天平称出托盘和砝码的总质量 m，滑块及遮光条的总质量为 M。回答下列问题：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d0468d62eb5c752ca65586707a1dea6e79915fb665a774d1ce7d8c5d11b985c5.png","width":750,"height":171,"width_mm":88.194,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-Ⅰ题图3\n①关于该实验的操作，下列说法正确的是（填空）（多选）\nA. 实验前需要将导轨调至水平\nB. 质量 m 和 M 的大小不需满足 m 远远小于 M\nC. 调节定滑轮使细线与轨道平行\nD. 遮光条宽度 d 越小，测速度的误差越小\n②保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 不变, 在滑块上加砝码, 改变总质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" , 重复实验得到多组 ( "},{"type":"math","value":"M_i"},{"type":"text","value":" , "},{"type":"math","value":"t_i"},{"type":"text","value":" ) 数据。用图像法处理数据, 在力不变的情况下探究加速度与质量的关系, 则需要绘出（填空）\nA. "},{"type":"math","value":"t^2-M"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像\nB. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{t^2}-M"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像\nC. "},{"type":"math","value":"t-M"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像\nD. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{t}-M"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像\n若在实验误差范围内图像是一条过原点的直线，则表明（填空）。\n14-Ⅱ. （7 分）某实验小组准备测量一款充电宝的电动势与内阻，经查阅资料后获悉，充电宝电动势稳定，内阻小。\n（1）他们先用多用电表的 10V 直流电压档直接测量充电宝电动势，表盘示数如图 1 所示，则充电宝的电动势为 （填空）V;\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e2d678d32482612c476172a727fae3c99fb643f9c66d441cfeb11a1cdad43ced.png","width":549,"height":288,"width_mm":64.558,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2b38a695ac3321ab921047c00003dc544a8b77f60ca48524166e5578bd6a14f4.png","width":282,"height":261,"width_mm":33.161,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ec5538e1f3b281d0172c43d0a190107dabe7fa81e00ab1acdeac7ab1d425d480.png","width":354,"height":399,"width_mm":41.628,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ee6b9626db4557cc37e9ced8a5bf2a37149f921d36a37bb24e10c4045d10ec85.png","width":480,"height":381,"width_mm":62.089,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图4\n第14-Ⅱ题图\n（2）小组同学进一步用伏安法测量充电宝的电动势与内阻，讨论后设计了如图 2 所示的电路，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为定值电阻， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为电阻箱， "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为滑动变阻器。图 3 为相应的未完成的实物连线图，请补线完成；\n（3）已知伏特表量程为 3V，内阻为 3k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}=0.5\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ，把变阻箱的阻值也调为 3k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，调节滑动变阻器，得到多组电压表与电流表的读数，以电压表读数为纵坐标，电流表读数为横坐标，作出 U-I 图线如图 4，则该充电宝的电动势 E=（填空）V(保留 3 位有效数字)，内阻 r=（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"(保留 2 位有效数字)。\n(4) 针对下列不同规格的滑动变阻器, 本实验选择（填空）\nA. 最大电流 5A, 最大阻值 20"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB. 最大电流 3A, 最大阻值 200"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC. 最大电流 0.5A, 最大阻值 20"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（5）定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的作用是 （填空）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（Ⅰ、Ⅱ两题共14分）\n14-Ⅰ.【答案】\n(1) AC 2分\n(2) 3.65～3.75 1分\n0.20 1分\n(3) ① AC 1分\n② A 1分\n在外力不变时物体的加速度与质量成反比 1分\n【解析】\n（1）本实验采用控制变量的方法，故 A 正确；调节轨道的倾斜度，使小车在不受牵引时能恰好带着纸带沿轨道匀速下滑，故 B 错误；取等质量槽码可以近似成倍地改变小车所受的拉力，故 C 正确；小车速度快，一是阻力增大，二是槽码质量与小车质量关系不满足远小于关系，故 D 错。\n（2）根据"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = aT^2"},{"type":"text","value":"可解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{x_{DG} - x_{AD}}{9T^2} = \\frac{(6.50 - 2.60) - (2.60 - 0.50)}{9\\times 0.1^2}\\times 10^{-2} = 0.20\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）①该实验需要将导轨调至水平，故 A 正确；本实验 m 和 M 的大小需满足 m 远远小于 M，故 B 错误；C．调节定滑轮使细线与轨道平行，故 C 正确；D. d 过小，测量 d 和时间误差大，D 不正确\n②"},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{v^2}{2l} = \\frac{d^2}{2t^2l}"},{"type":"text","value":"，需要绘制"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a} - M"},{"type":"text","value":"图验证加速度与质量成反比，故A正确。\n14-Ⅱ.（7 分）\n（1）5.4 V 1 分\n（2）如图，说明：滑动变阻器接线如果未接在接线柱上，如接在滑动变阻器脚上等都不得分；二条线有一条线错不得分 1 分"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/00950852067427daf4ef6ea5dfc0f3758c13e371870217a3a6d14f9b6994fb1c.png","width":275,"height":302,"width_mm":34.8},{"type":"text","value":"（3）5.44 V～5.48 V 1 分\n0.22 Ω～0.24 Ω 2 分\n（4）A 1 分\n（5）保护作用；移动滑动变阻器滑片时让伏特表变化明显；两者说出一个得分 1 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511","source_question_id":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c6695ba619f255c06d676d96da577ae52b3d4f4bd961149bc3a39447f659dbfe","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）如图所示，一定质量的理想气体被活塞封闭在圆筒形的金属气缸内，活塞的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=20kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ，截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=100cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，活塞可沿气缸壁无摩擦滑动且不漏气，开始时封闭气柱长度为 20cm，外界气温 "},{"type":"math","value":"t=27^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" 。将质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的重物缓慢放到活塞上，稳定后活塞下降了 5cm；再对气缸内气体缓慢加热，气体吸收了 Q=186J 的热量，活塞又上升了 3cm，求：\n（1）重物的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）加热前后缸内气体温度的增加值 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）加热前后缸内气体内能的变化量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ee6ac538aecdd5d9542bce762dc861927188e3e4da56b056e88b16e72520584c.png","width":525,"height":216,"width_mm":61.736,"row_group":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）\n解：（1）状态1（初始），有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1 = p_0 + \\frac{m_1g}{s}, l_1 = 20\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"①\n状态 2"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=p_{0}+\\frac{(m_{1}+m_{2})g}{s},\\quad l_{2}=15cm"},{"type":"text","value":"①\n等温过程方程"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}l_{1}S = p_{2}l_{2}S"},{"type":"text","value":"②\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=40kg"},{"type":"text","value":"③\n（2）缓慢加热，状态 3，"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{3}=p_{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"l_{3}=18cm"},{"type":"text","value":"等压过程方程"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{l_{2}S}{T_{2}}=\\frac{l_{3}S}{T_{2}+\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"④"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t=60^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑤\n（3）从状态2至状态3内气体对外做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W = p_{2}(l_{3} - l_{2})S"},{"type":"text","value":"⑥\n由热力学第一定律，有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = Q - W"},{"type":"text","value":"⑦\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 138\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑧\n评分标准：①～⑧式各1分，共8分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511","source_question_id":"zhedongbei-lianmeng-2511-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7deea07e285cbb506099f3e6e83c20e42ae9343e8caa8e6e1d8d1b2c0b83008e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）如图所示，倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的倾斜传送带 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 长 "},{"type":"math","value":"l = 1.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，以速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针匀速运转。一小煤块轻放在传送带上端 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 处，经 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 到达C（C'）点进入螺